id=afterimage
name=Afterimage
version=v@VERSION@
versionCode=@VERSION_CODE@
author=SoansSandha
description=Your lock-screen photo turns into a glowing outline on the always-on display (Pixel 9 Pro XL, Android 17). Installs the Afterimage app as a system app and opens Android's wallpaper-on-AOD path. The action button turns the wallpaper on AOD off and on.
